---
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    fontFamily: "Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"
    fontSize: 14px
    primaryColor: "#e8f1fb"
    primaryBorderColor: "#6d9ed3"
    primaryTextColor: "#0b2a4a"
    lineColor: "#333333"
    noteBkgColor: "#ffffff"
    noteBorderColor: "#ffffff"
    noteTextColor: "#666666"
    actorBkg: "#e8f1fb"
    actorBorder: "#6d9ed3"
  themeCSS: >-
    svg, text, tspan, span, p, div { font-family: "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; }
    .noteText, .noteText tspan { font-weight: 600; fill: #222 !important; font-size: 15px !important; }
    .labelText, .loopText, .loopText tspan { font-weight: bold; fill: #444 !important; }
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant R as Renter
  participant API as Booking API
  participant Q as Queue
  participant MM as Matchmaker worker
  participant DB as Database
  participant SIG as Connection setup
  participant PC as Gaming PC
  participant ICE as STUN / TURN

  rect rgb(247, 247, 247)
  Note over R,ICE: 1 · A PC becomes available
  PC->>DB: available now, until available_until
  loop every few seconds
    PC->>DB: heartbeat (last_seen_at)
  end
  PC->>SIG: WebSocket · register, wait for a renter
  end

  rect rgb(255, 255, 255)
  Note over R,ICE: 2 · The renter books a game (signed in with Steam)
  R->>API: POST /bookings { gameId, minutes }
  API->>DB: booking · queued
  API->>Q: enqueue
  API-->>R: 202 { bookingId }
  MM->>Q: pull next booking
  loop every 5s until a machine is found
    MM->>DB: find free machines
  end
  MM->>DB: write reservation + expires_at<br/>(holds the machine for this booking, free again if unclaimed by expires_at)
  MM->>SIG: session grant · room id + who may join
  end

  rect rgb(247, 247, 247)
  Note over R,ICE: 3 · The renter connects
  loop until matched
    R->>API: GET /bookings/:id
  end
  R->>API: POST /bookings/:id/claim
  API->>DB: reservation → session (started_at)
  API-->>R: { sessionId, roomId, signalingUrl }
  R->>SIG: WebSocket · join room
  SIG->>PC: renter joined
  PC->>SIG: offer (SDP)
  SIG->>R: offer
  R->>SIG: answer (SDP)
  SIG->>PC: answer
  par
    R->>ICE: what is my public address?
  and
    PC->>ICE: what is my public address?
  end
  R-->SIG: ICE candidates, both ways
  SIG-->PC: ICE candidates, both ways
  PC->>R: WebRTC · video + audio (direct, or via TURN) · Connection setup no longer on the path
  R->>PC: WebRTC · mouse, keyboard, gamepad
  end

  rect rgb(255, 255, 255)
  Note over R,ICE: 4 · The session ends (renter leaves, time runs out, or owner's kill switch)
  PC->>DB: session ended · ended_at, price
  PC->>DB: available again
  end
